{"id":"56ec8377fc84ab9d","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness.md","title":"Theorem 1: Incompleteness from a Truth-Set Fixed Point","display":"thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness — Theorem 1: Incompleteness from a Truth-Set Fixed Point","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness — Theorem 1: Incompleteness from a Truth-Set Fixed Point","source":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 1（PDF 144）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness — Theorem 1: Incompleteness from a Truth-Set Fixed Point"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 1（PDF 144）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5214366b706950b4\" href=\"?note=5214366b706950b4\" title=\"92-df-abstract-truth-set\">92-df-abstract-truth-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq T\">\\(P\\subseteq T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in S\">\\(\\gamma\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in T\">\\((\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_M,\\leftrightarrow_M\">\\(\\neg_M,\\leftrightarrow_M\\)</span> 来自抽象系统节点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\gamma\\in T\\land\\gamma\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\gamma\\in T\\land\\gamma\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 γ∈P，则由 P⊆T 有 γ∈T，而真值集条件给出 Bγ∈T。固定点在 T 中为真却要求 γ 与 ¬Bγ 同真值，矛盾。故 γ∉P；真值集条件给出 Bγ∉T，经典 valuation 给出 ¬Bγ∈T，再由固定点得 γ∈T。于是 ¬γ∉T，而 P⊆T 保证 ¬γ∉P。</p>\n<p>固定点只要求在 T 中成立，未要求在 P 中可证；也不需要 Type1、Normal、P2/P3。它是原书抽象 Tarski–Gödel 语义路线，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40e368f900e65306\" href=\"?note=40e368f900e65306\" title=\"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness\">92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness</a> 的可证固定点路线条件不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-truth-set","status":"resolved","id":"5214366b706950b4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"40e368f900e65306","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"固定点只要求在 T 中成立，未要求在 P 中可证；也不需要 Type1、Normal、P2/P3。它是原书抽象 Tarski–Gödel 语义路线，与 [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]] 的可证固定点路线条件不同。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_M,\\leftrightarrow_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\gamma\\in T\\land\\gamma\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.","display":true}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]] → [[92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness]]；[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]] → [[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]] → [[92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness]]。这里的真固定点与可证固定点、Φ 枚举与外部 c.e. 枚举分别保留。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["5214366b706950b4","40e368f900e65306"]}